      bash tests/selftest.sh -> SELFTEST: PASS (rc 0)
      bash scripts/boardctl validate -> RESULT: OK (3 warning(s), pre-existing)
      bash docs/audits/cf099-prd-drift-probe.sh -> OK (rc 0)
